# LASP SSW/random-walk example derived from the repository's audited
# Li10M7P8S32/run/11113 input shape. Replace the potential/DFT setup and
# auxiliary files with those for your own licensed LASP case.
potential vasp
explore_type ssw
Run_type 5
SSW.SSWsteps 4
SSW.MaxOptstep 300
SSW.Temp 200.0000
SSW.printdelay 2
SSW.printselect 6
SSW.printevery T
SSW.output T
SSW.DimerdR 0.010
SSW.ftol 0.1000
